#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "HTTP rate limit reference guide"
msgstr "HTTP 速率限制参考指南"

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr "这项技术被认为是{extension-status}。"

msgid ""
"In _experimental_ mode, early feedback is requested to mature the idea.\n"
"There is no guarantee of stability nor long term presence in the platform until the solution matures.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr "在 _experimental(实验)_ 模式下，要求早期反馈以使想法成熟。在解决方案成熟之前，不保证稳定性或长期存在于平台中。欢迎在我们的 link:https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[邮件列表] 中提供反馈，或在我们的 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub问题列表] 中提出问题。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr "如需查看所有可能状态的完整列表，请参阅我们的 link:https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-are-the-extension-statuses[常见问题解答] 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rate limiting controls how frequently a client can access an application.\n"
"It stops a single caller from using more than its share: a client stuck in a retry loop, someone guessing passwords on a login page, or a customer that goes beyond its plan."
msgstr "速率限制用于控制客户端访问应用程序的频率。它可防止单个调用者占用超过其应得份额的资源：例如，陷入重试循环的客户端、在登录页面上尝试猜测密码的用户，或是超出套餐限额的客户。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `quarkus-http-rate-limit` extension enforces rate limits in the Quarkus HTTP layer, before requests reach application endpoints.\n"
"You configure named rules that select HTTP paths and methods, identify which requests share a limit, and define the permitted request rate.\n"
"Requests that exceed a limit receive `429 Too Many Requests` with a `Retry-After` header.\n"
"The extension rejects excess requests immediately; it does not queue them until capacity becomes available."
msgstr "`quarkus-http-rate-limit` 扩展在请求到达应用程序端点之前，就在 Quarkus HTTP 层中实施速率限制。 您可以配置命名规则来筛选 HTTP 路径和方法，确定哪些请求共享同一配额，并定义允许的请求速率。超过配额的请求将收到 `429 Too Many Requests` 状态码，并附带 `Retry-After` 标头。该扩展会立即拒绝超额请求，不会将其排队等待直至容量恢复。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Start with <<getting-started>> to configure and try one rule.\n"
"The next sections explain that rule, how its permits replenish, and how to count requests by client.\n"
"Then use <<common-tasks>> to adapt it to your application."
msgstr "请先访问 <<getting-started>> 来配置并测试一条规则。接下来的章节将详细说明该规则、其配额的恢复机制，以及如何按客户端统计请求数量。然后，请访问 <<common-tasks>> 将其适配到您的应用程序中。"

