"Keep `lease-size` small next to the limit, at most `permits / 20`; the extension warns otherwise.\n"
"Lease mode does not help when most requests come with a key that the instance has not seen recently."
msgstr "代价在于精度：所有实例加起来可能允许的请求数量超过了限制，且该数量可能达到 `租用大小的水平` 。请将 `租用大小` 设置在接近限制的水平，且不超过 `允许值的 1/20` ；否则扩展功能会发出警告。当大多数请求携带的密钥是实例近期未曾处理过的时，租用模式将无法发挥作用。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default, a request that finds no permit at hand waits for one call to Redis.\n"
"With `max-overdraft=k`, an instance instead admits up to `k` such requests without waiting, and pays for them with its next call; if Redis refuses, they got through over the limit.\n"
"Use it for limits where waiting costs more than an occasional extra request."
msgstr "默认情况下，如果请求发现当前没有可用配额，则会等待一次对 Redis 的调用。当设置 `max-overdraft=k` 时，实例最多可接受 `k 个` 此类请求而无需等待，并在下次调用时一并处理；如果 Redis 拒绝，则说明这些请求已超出配额限制。 当等待的成本高于偶尔多处理一个请求的成本时，可使用此配置。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Lease guarantees and tradeoffs"
msgstr "租赁担保与权衡"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A claim takes between 1 and `lease-size` permits from the store, depending on how many the instance used recently, and never more than half of what the store said was left.\n"
